<p>Your psionic powers have no limits. You are now able to assault a target and clone its body without killing it.</p><p>The form is only temporary, lasting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns and subject to the same restrictions as your normal powers.</p><p>While using a stolen form your health is bound to your target. (Your life% will always be identical to your target's life%)</p><p></p>